&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;key-achievements&#34;&gt;Key Achievements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;python-monolithic-system-v118--aim-v10&#34;&gt;Python Monolithic System (v1.1.8 / AIM V1.0)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software&lt;/strong&gt;: &amp;ldquo;AIM Intelligent Target Tracking System&amp;rdquo; with multi-threaded architecture, SimplePID controller, SimpleTargetTracker, and CoordinateConverter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;: Intelligent degradation protection, auto-tuning, and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
